#title[Notes]

I have been building Paiagram since November 2025. But the idea of building a Marey chart editor has
been in my head for a much longer time.

I wouldn't even say that I am a railway fan; what I studied in high school and university also
aren't related with trains or timetables. I don't know much about railway operations, timetables,
dispatching, trains, etc., and I was composing the features of the app based on what I saw from
games such as #link("https://openttd.org")[OpenTTD], #link("https://www.transportfever3.com/")[
  Transport Fever], #link("https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A-Train")[A-Train], and prior art,
including OuDia(Second) and qETRC.
